%h2 Welcome to BucketWise!

%p
  %strong To get started
  , you'll need to create at least one account
  (a bank account, credit card account, etc). "Accounts" are where your money is
  actually stored.

%p.create
  = link_to "Click here to create your first account", "#", "data-action": "click->accounts-form#reveal"

%p
  %strong Once you've created
  your first account, you can create more accounts,
  record transactions, and basically get on with keeping your finances
  under control!
